    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Comparator</code></a> implementation to compare objects based on a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/PropertyPath.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>PropertyPath</code></a>. This comparator obtains the\nvalue at <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/PropertyPath.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>PropertyPath</code></a> from the <a href=\"#compare(T,T)\"><code>given comparison objects</code></a> and then performs\nthe comparison.",
      "translation": "基于<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/PropertyPath.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>PropertyPath</code></a>实现用于比较对象的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Comparator</code></a>。该比较器从<a href=\"#compare(T,T)\"><code>给定的比较对象</code></a>中获取<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/PropertyPath.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>PropertyPath</code></a>处的值，然后执行比较。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html#compare(T,T)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\">compare</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\">Comparator</a>&lt;<a href=\"#type-param-T\" title=\"type parameter in PropertyPathComparator\">T</a>&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html#compare(T,T)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\">compare</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\">Comparator</a>&lt;<a href=\"#type-param-T\" title=\"类型参数在 PropertyPathComparator 中\">T</a>&gt;</code>` 中的方法",
